        "what": "Wrapped the call to l2cap_unregister_user in a conditional check to verify session->conn is not NULL.",
        "how": "Prevents passing a NULL pointer to l2cap_unregister_user, avoiding potential kernel crashes or undefined behavior during session cleanup."
